data: {"type":"citation","data":{"chunkId":"c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002","documentId":"22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222","filename":"02-vector-retrieval.md","snippet":"pgvector 是 PostgreSQL 的向量扩展。它给数据库加了向量类型、向量距离运算符和向量索引。","score":0.68}}

id: 3
event: citation
data: {"type":"citation","data":{"chunkId":"c0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003","documentId":"11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111","filename":"02-vector-retrieval.md","snippet":"HNSW 是 pgvector 提供的近似最近邻索引。它把向量组织成多层图，查询时从稀疏的上层快速跳到目标区域附近，再在稠密的下层做局部搜索。","score":0.64}}

